OL,3,GNEWSAProtests as controversial Drumcree
OL,4,AOrange Order march due to go ahead for
OL,5,Afirst time since 1997
OL,6,
OL,7,FA controversial parade organised by
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland's Orange Order is due
OL,9,Fto go down the mainly nationalist
OL,10,FGarvaghy Road later this morning for
OL,11,Fthe first time in almost 30 years
OL,13,FThe Orange Order, the most prominent of
OL,14,Fthe loyal orders associated with
OL,15,FProtestants, say the Garvaghy Road is
OL,16,Fpart of its traditional marching route
OL,17,Fbut the event is opposed by many
OL,18,FCatholic residents who live there
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
