OL,3,GNEWSAProtests as controversial Drumcree
OL,4,AOrange Order march due to go ahead for
OL,5,Afirst time since 1997
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe parade comes after 24 hours of
OL,8,Flegal drama that went into the early
OL,9,Fhours of Sunday, with the High Court
OL,10,Fruling that an initial decision to
OL,11,Fallow the march to take place had to be
OL,12,Frespected
OL,14,FThe Parades Commission had ruled on
OL,15,FFriday that the march can go ahead, but
OL,16,Fwith 35 participants and no bands
OL,17,Ftaking part
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
