OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAProtests as controversial Drumcree
OL,4,AOrange Order march due to go ahead for
OL,5,Afirst time since 1997
OL,6,
OL,7,FA dispute over the march in the 1990s
OL,8,Fsparked some of the most serious
OL,9,Fdisorder in Northern Ireland's history,
OL,10,Fand led to the formation of the Parades
OL,11,FCommission to adjudicate on
OL,12,Fcontroversial marches
OL,14,FThe march is due to begin at 08:00 BST
OL,15,Fand last no longer than 90 minutes
OL,17,FIt will travel from Portadown town
OL,18,Fcentre out to Drumcree church, before
OL,19,Freturning via the Garvaghy Road
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
